{"body": [{"y0": 67.1, "x0": 68.7, "x1": 297.0, "text": "Discipuli: ^Ei, ei! Quid nos verberas, magister?\""}, {"y0": 84.3, "x0": 39.6, "x1": 311.9, "text": "120 . Diodorus: \"Vos verbero, quod alio modo vós excitare"}, {"y0": 103.2, "x0": 57.6, "x1": 309.9, "text": "non possum. Ad sellàs vestrás redite atque considite!\""}, {"y0": 121.6, "x0": 68.9, "x1": 302.0, "text": "Discipuli ad sellàs suás redeunt, neque considunt."}, {"y0": 140.0, "x0": 68.4, "x1": 222.3, "text": "Magister: *Quid nón cónsiditis?\""}, {"y0": 158.0, "x0": 68.7, "x1": 311.7, "text": "Discipuli: ^Nón considimus, quod sedére nón possu-"}, {"y0": 176.1, "x0": 39.0, "x1": 84.9, "text": "125 mus.\""}, {"y0": 194.3, "x0": 68.7, "x1": 311.7, "text": "Diodorus: \"Quid? Sedére non potestis? Ergo vos hó-"}, {"y0": 212.9, "x0": 57.6, "x1": 311.7, "text": "ram tótam taciti státe, dum ego sedéns partem libri pos-"}, {"y0": 230.9, "x0": 57.6, "x1": 300.6, "text": "teriorem recitó! Nec enim stantes dormire potestis!\""}, {"y0": 277.5, "x0": 57.2, "x1": 170.6, "text": "GRAMMATICA LATINA"}, {"y0": 291.7, "x0": 38.5, "x1": 116.6, "text": "130 Personae verbi"}, {"y0": 305.6, "x0": 67.5, "x1": 194.4, "text": "Pueri rident. Puella nón rider."}, {"y0": 319.4, "x0": 67.6, "x1": 256.1, "text": "Pueri: *Cür t4 nón rides, cum nos ridéemus?\""}, {"y0": 333.1, "x0": 67.6, "x1": 258.1, "text": "Puella: *Ego nón rideo, quia v0s mé ridetis/^"}, {"y0": 347.1, "x0": 67.6, "x1": 311.7, "text": "*Rideó ridemus' dicitur persona prima, 'rides ridétis' per-"}, {"y0": 361.2, "x0": 38.1, "x1": 235.4, "text": "135 sóna secunda, 'ridet rident! persona tertia."}, {"y0": 375.2, "x0": 133.5, "x1": 241.5, "text": "Singularis Plüralis"}, {"y0": 388.2, "x0": 56.8, "x1": 244.6, "text": "Persóna prima  ride|o ridé|mus"}, {"y0": 401.9, "x0": 57.0, "x1": 238.3, "text": "Persóna secunda  ridé|s ride|tis"}, {"y0": 414.8, "x0": 57.0, "x1": 237.4, "text": "Persóna tertia —— ride|t ride[nt"}, {"y0": 429.6, "x0": 38.1, "x1": 311.2, "text": "1409 Exempla: [1] clàm|ó clamà|mus; (2] ride|ó ride|mus; [3]"}, {"y0": 443.6, "x0": 57.4, "x1": 267.4, "text": "dic|ó dic|imus; faci|ó faci|mus; [4] audi|ó audi|mus."}, {"y0": 458.7, "x0": 67.1, "x1": 311.2, "text": "Malus discipulus in lüdó clàmat et ridet. Qui id nón facit,"}, {"y0": 472.8, "x0": 57.2, "x1": 275.7, "text": "et omnia verba magistri audit, bonus est discipulus."}, {"y0": 486.3, "x0": 67.3, "x1": 311.7, "text": "Bonus discipulus malo dicit: *Ego bonus discipulus sum: in"}, {"y0": 500.0, "x0": 38.7, "x1": 311.7, "text": "145 ]üdó nec clamo nec rideo, et omnia verba magistri audio. At"}, {"y0": 514.2, "x0": 57.2, "x1": 311.7, "text": "tü malus discipulus es: in lüdo clàmds et rides nec verba"}, {"y0": 528.4, "x0": 57.2, "x1": 311.4, "text": "magistri audzs/ Verum dico! Nonne hoc facis?\" Malus disci-"}, {"y0": 542.1, "x0": 57.2, "x1": 291.2, "text": "pulus: *Quod dicis vérum nón est: ego hoc nón facio/\""}], "margin": [{"y0": 69.2, "x0": 325.4, "x1": 380.5, "text": "nós acc (7 nóm)"}, {"y0": 87.2, "x0": 325.4, "x1": 379.7, "text": "vos acc ( nom)"}, {"y0": 123.8, "x0": 326.3, "x1": 380.3, "text": "red-ire -it -eunt"}, {"y0": 161.9, "x0": 325.9, "x1": 363.9, "text": "pos-sumus"}, {"y0": 169.3, "x0": 325.7, "x1": 355.3, "text": "pot-estis"}, {"y0": 179.9, "x0": 325.7, "x1": 355.8, "text": "pos-sunt"}, {"y0": 291.5, "x0": 325.2, "x1": 373.4, "text": "persona (pers)"}, {"y0": 308.3, "x0": 325.0, "x1": 374.3, "text": "ego nos"}, {"y0": 316.5, "x0": 325.2, "x1": 374.0, "text": "tü vós"}, {"y0": 334.0, "x0": 325.4, "x1": 390.9, "text": "rideo ridemus"}, {"y0": 343.2, "x0": 325.4, "x1": 385.5, "text": "rides ridetis"}, {"y0": 351.5, "x0": 325.4, "x1": 384.6, "text": "ridet rident"}, {"y0": 380.4, "x0": 337.6, "x1": 385.5, "text": "sing. plür."}, {"y0": 390.0, "x0": 324.7, "x1": 385.1, "text": "I -ó -mus"}, {"y0": 404.2, "x0": 324.7, "x1": 379.6, "text": "H -$ -tis"}, {"y0": 419.5, "x0": 324.3, "x1": 378.5, "text": "IH -£ -nt"}, {"y0": 442.2, "x0": 325.0, "x1": 366.2, "t